        "original_id": "e2c7b3c0-54cd-5eec-af63-fbe8e528598a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Selina Giles, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Stephen Rea, James McTeigue, The Wachowskis, Alan Moore, David Lloyd\n- Works: Until Death, V for Vendetta, V for Vendetta comic series\n- Organizations: DC, Vertigo Comics\n- Topics: film roles, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, V for Vendetta was released as a dystopian political thriller film.\n- James McTeigue directed the 2005 film V for Vendetta.\n- The Wachowskis wrote the 2005 film V for Vendetta.\n- V for Vendetta was based on the 1988 DC/Vertigo Comics limited series of the same name by Alan Moore and David Lloyd.\n- Selina Giles is best known for playing Valerie Stowe in Until Death with Jean-Claude Van Damme and Stephen Rea.\n- Selina Giles is also known for playing Evey's mother in the Wachowskis film V for Vendetta.",
